 "description": "<p>LINN is the name on the box, and the toy splits itself in two: one side delivers clitoral suction through the rose head, the other adds a vibrating bullet suited to gentle external massage anywhere you point it. The pairing is deliberate — suction builds slowly, vibration finishes fast, and having both on one body means no mid-session swap.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_a86efccd-ed4a-4249-bf31-012ca6ac7e5c_480x480.jpg?v=1690168881\"></p>\n<p>Seven frequency modes run the suction channel with a blow-out pattern that changes character every cycle; ten vibration modes run the massage side, from low drumming up through fast tapping. Below 40 dB, the whole thing is quieter than a fridge hum, which is the figure that matters for apartment use.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_94496fb4-26f4-4688-b0c0-07b5d7b0e3b8_480x480.jpg?v=1690168929\"></p>\n<p>The control logic is thought through: a two-second press drops it into standby, and ten idle minutes later it shuts itself off instead of draining the battery in a drawer.</p>\n<p><img data-mce-fragment=\"1\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibrato2_480x480.jpg?v=1690168889\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: clitoral suction + vibrating bullet (2-in-1)</li>\n<li>Modes: 7 suction frequencies, 10 vibration modes</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone and ABS</li>\n<li>Noise: below 40 dB</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n<li>Auto standby: shuts off after 10 idle minutes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_7_e3ff887c-99c5-4e27-9719-239dd040b155_480x480.jpg?v=1690168884\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_8_d5d83930-c938-42dc-966a-b635d42ca558_480x480.jpg?v=1690168887\"></p>\n<p>A two-channel rose that manages its own battery — small disciplines that add up.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>LINN 2-in-1 rose toy with 7 suction frequencies and 10 vibration modes, sub-40 dB motor, IPX7 body and auto standby shutdown.</p>\n",
